@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
@token = {{accessToken}}

### Create session
POST {{apiUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Info: HTTP Client / Desktop

{
  "email": "user@email.local",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Refresh session
POST {{apiUrl}}/sessions/refresh

### List my sessions
# Query parameters: page, perPage, sort (createdAt|lastUsedAt|expiresAt), sortDir (asc|desc), userId, familyId, activeOnly (boolean).
GET {{apiUrl}}/sessions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one of my sessions
# Query parameters: none.
GET {{apiUrl}}/sessions/me/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke all my sessions
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/sessions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke a session
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/sessions/me/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
